1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,600
I'm sorry. You said no. I shouldn't have touched you.

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:06,933
Whether I want to or not, you have to ask me, not decide for me.

3
00:00:07,466 --> 00:00:08,666
Let me walk you back to the guest room, okay?

4
00:00:09,466 --> 00:00:11,400
No need. I want to walk alone for a bit.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,100
Okay. I won't follow.

6
00:00:18,466 --> 00:00:21,366
Nawin, I brought the art supplies you left behind.

7
00:00:22,666 --> 00:00:24,466
Put them on the table. I haven't forgiven you yet.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,400
I came to apologize. I shouldn't have forced a kiss on you yesterday.

9
00:00:31,166 --> 00:00:33,033
Then remember this: when I say stop, you stop.

10
00:00:35,566 --> 00:00:38,466
Got it. Can I help you with your cuffs?

11
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,100
No need. I can manage.

12
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,700
Why did you come back yesterday after buying the supplies?

13
00:00:46,333 --> 00:00:49,233
I wanted to see you then. Now, I just want peace to finish my painting.

14
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,733
Then I'll sit further away. You just paint; I won't bother you.

15
00:00:54,233 --> 00:00:56,766
What about you, Ah Tan? What else do you want?

16
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:59,566
I want to keep seeing you. If you don't want to, I'll leave.

17
00:01:02,466 --> 00:01:05,000
Will Thanat really let you be with whoever you like?

18
00:01:06,166 --> 00:01:08,066
I like you. That's none of his business.

19
00:01:09,666 --> 00:01:12,600
Don't talk me into secretly liking you, only to make me hide away.

20
00:01:14,366 --> 00:01:18,433
I won't make you hide. Just give me some time to sort this out, okay?

21
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:23,233
Then walk with me first. I'll pick where we go.

22
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,333
Sure. Wherever you go, I'll be right there.

23
00:01:26,766 --> 00:01:28,066
Today I feel like painting the road outside.

24
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:33,500
Yeah. Today I'll lead the way, and you'll follow.

25
00:01:38,333 --> 00:01:40,533
Can you save a spot for me in the painting?

26
00:01:42,233 --> 00:01:44,366
Saved one for you. Stand wherever you want.

27
00:01:47,633 --> 00:01:48,966
So this is the empty studio you mentioned?

28
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:49,600
Who used it before?

29
00:01:51,466 --> 00:01:54,933
It's always been empty. The guest room table is small, so you'll have more room to paint here.

30
00:01:55,900 --> 00:01:58,400
Then it's a deal: this piece doesn't go to the Ratchawong family.

31
00:01:59,866 --> 00:02:02,200
Not for the Ratchawong family, then let Ah Tan have a look.

32
00:02:03,733 --> 00:02:06,366
No painting for now. But... you can kiss me.
